# The native libraries the macOS release links instead of Homebrew's (canon row 248: the 13.0 floor is only honest when
# every library is built for it). The versions are the ones the port is developed and tested against on both OSes
# (Homebrew on the Mac, vcpkg on Windows, 2026-11-09). A point release moves by editing this file and the commit beside it;
# a minor bump re-runs `cargo test -p min-image -p qcv-color` on both machines (tools/image-libs/README.md).
# Each tag is checked against its commit after the clone — a moved tag fails the build.
